                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCreery to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-12-26"><hi rendition="#italic">December 26,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Note just received from foreign office stating President has granted extradition
                    Kratz.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McCreery.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
